1
00:00:00,369 --> 00:00:01,369
(Howard:)I'm sorry.

2
00:00:01,537 --> 00:00:04,537
(Sheldon:)I'm just distracted by something
that happened over at Penny's.

3
00:00:04,707 --> 00:00:05,707
(Amy:)What happened?

4
00:00:05,875 --> 00:00:08,545
(Sheldon:)I fear Penny is being unfaithful
to Leonard.

5
00:00:08,711 --> 00:00:11,521
(Penny:)-What?
-She claimed to be alone

6
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:14,790
(Sheldon:)when there was obviously
someone else in her apartment.

7
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:17,290
(Sheldon:)I have no choice but
to assume the worst,

8
00:00:17,453 --> 00:00:19,453
(Sheldon:)given Leonard's lengthy sea voyage

9
00:00:19,622 --> 00:00:22,792
(Sheldon:)and her famously
ravenous nether regions.

10
00:00:24,126 --> 00:00:25,866
(Amy:)I don't think Penny
would cheat on Leonard.

11
00:00:26,028 --> 00:00:28,068
(Sheldon:)Oh, really?

12
00:00:29,899 --> 00:00:32,779
(Sheldon:)She and I once had
a staring contest.

13
00:00:32,935 --> 00:00:35,575
(Sheldon:)She clapped really loud
and made me blink.

14
00:00:37,106 --> 00:00:41,056
(Sheldon:)It's a small leap from there
to sexual infidelity.

15
00:00:42,244 --> 00:00:44,224
(Amy:)You're being ridiculous.

16
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:49,300
(Sheldon:)Amy, there were Chinese
food containersu. in the trash can.

17
00:00:50,986 --> 00:00:58,026
(Amy:)Poor Leonard.

